o date with the hottest tracks!\n\nYou can find our playlist through YouTube and Google searches using these words too: pop mix, pop music, top pop playlist, good pop music, pop mashup, timeless pop hits, popular, pop songs, pop music playlist, famous pop songs, timeless pop songs, pop playlist, pop songs, pop songs list, best pop music, pop hit & top pop hits.\n\nWe recommend you to check other playlists or our favorite music charts. If you enjoyed listening to this one, you maybe will like:\n\n1. Best Pop Music Videos - Top Pop Hits Playlist (Updated Weekly 2026) - "},{"text":"http://play.red-music.com/3495"},{"text":" \n\nIn the next year, you will be able to find this playlist with the next title: Pop Music Playlist - Timeless Pop Songs (Updated Weekly 2027)\n\nLast Year's Title: Pop Music Playlist - Timeless Pop Songs (Updated Weekly 2025)\n\nShare your thoughts on our playlist: contact@red-music.com"}]},"moreButton":{"toggleButtonRenderer":{"isToggled":false,"isDisabled":false,"defaultIcon":{"iconType":"EXPAND"},"defaultText":{"runs":[{"text":"More"}]},"toggledIcon":{"iconType":"COLLAPSE"},"toggledText":{"runs":[{"text":"Less"}]}}},"shelfStyle":"MUSIC_SHELF_STYLE_OPEN_DIALOG_ON_CLICK"}},"secondSubtitle":{"runs":[{"text":"1B views"},{"text":" • "},{"text":"200 tracks"},{"text":" • "},{"text":"12+ hours"}]},"facepile":{"avatarStackViewModel":{"avatars":[{"avatarViewModel":{"image":{"sources":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nf96C9RdEtI1FTNb6SVCy8ALI0MAkirEX2cBw8OTnbaQ=s48-c-k-c0x00000000-no-cc-rj-rp"}],"processor":{"borderImageProcessor":{"circular":true}}},"avatarImageSize":"AVATAR_SIZE_XS"}}],"text":{"content":"Redlist - Just Hits"},"rendererContext":{"accessibilityContext":{"label":"Redlist - Just Hits"},"commandContext":{"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"UCs72iRpTEuwV3y6pdWYLgiw","browseEndpointContextSupportedConfigs":{"browseEndpointContextMusicConfig":{"pageType":"MUSIC_PAGE_TYPE_USER_CHANNEL"}}}}}}}}}}}],"targetId":"VLPLM